## Security rules

### `ssrf`

```typescript before
app.get("/preview", async (req, res) => {
  const page = await fetch(req.query.url);
  res.send(await page.text());
});
```

```typescript after
const ALLOWED_HOSTS = new Set(["images.acme.io"]);

app.get("/preview", async (req, res) => {
  const target = new URL(String(req.query.url));
  if (!ALLOWED_HOSTS.has(target.hostname)) return res.status(400).end();
  const page = await fetch(target);
  res.send(await page.text());
});
```

### `open-redirect`

```typescript before
app.get("/login/done", (req, res) => {
  res.redirect(req.query.next);
});
```

```typescript after
app.get("/login/done", (req, res) => {
  const next = String(req.query.next ?? "/");
  res.redirect(next.startsWith("/") && !next.startsWith("//") ? next : "/");
});
```

