## Change rules

### `oversized-change`

```text before
$ git diff --cached --stat
 38 files changed, 1250 insertions(+), 410 deletions(-)
```

```text after
$ git diff --cached --stat
 6 files changed, 180 insertions(+), 42 deletions(-)
```

### `complexity-ratchet`

```typescript before
// cyclomatic complexity 14 on main, 16 in this change
function route(request: Request): Response {
  if (request.path === "/health") return ok();
  if (request.path === "/metrics") return metrics(); // new branch
  // … 14 more branches
}
```

```typescript after
// cyclomatic complexity 3 in this change
const ROUTES: Record<string, Handler> = { "/health": ok, "/metrics": metrics /* … */ };

function route(request: Request): Response {
  return (ROUTES[request.path] ?? notFound)(request);
}
```

### `public-api-growth`

```swift before
// File: Sources/Billing/Ledger.swift
public func rebuildIndexes(in ledger: Ledger) {
    ledger.reindex()
}
```

```swift after
// File: Sources/Billing/Ledger.swift
